<!--
  The Foscal mark cut down for a 24dp status-bar slot.

  One row of three under a header band, not the launcher's three-by-three: at this size nine
  holes close up into a smear and the whole thing reads as a plain rounded square. The band is
  what keeps it a calendar rather than a dice face, and it is the same band the launcher icon
  draws in amber.

  No android:tint. The system tints a notification's small icon itself and keeps only the alpha
  channel, so a tint here is at best ignored and at worst resolved against the wrong theme.
-->
